#: ../../source/docs/advanced-pixhawk-quadcopter-wiring-chart.rst:5
#: f0a6bc5bc5794f5993144b5f994993f0
msgid "Advanced Pixhawk Quadcopter Wiring Chart"
msgstr "Advanced Pixhawk Quadcopter 接线图"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-pixhawk-quadcopter-wiring-chart.rst:7
#: 9d4cb41b7ee9478bb5884e9a39780798
msgid ""
"Jethro Hazelhurst produced this magnificent Pixhawk wiring chart for a "
"Quadcopter for us. (Other autopilots will be wired similarly)"
msgstr "Jethro Hazelhurst为我们制作了这张精美的Pixhawk四轴飞行器接线图。（其他飞控的接线方式类似）"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-pixhawk-quadcopter-wiring-chart.rst:10
#: b48ff0d7e5f14e20939c9f6840866c48
msgid "(Control Scroll wheel will let you zoom in on the image below!)"
msgstr "（使用Ctrl+滚轮可以放大下面的图像！）"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-pixhawk-quadcopter-wiring-chart.rst:16
#: cf398cfd068948f4b1d21191e4e70083
msgid "This chart Illustrates a quadcopter with a variety of options."
msgstr "该图说明了一款具有多种选项的四轴飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-pixhawk-quadcopter-wiring-chart.rst:18
#: 8ec00205763a40b2a0bdaccfa6c32b8a
msgid ""
"A 4 in 1 ESC is used instead of individual ESCs reducing EMF and allowing a "
"neater installation and no power distribution board."
msgstr "使用四合一ESC代替独立ESC，减少电磁干扰，安装更整洁，无需配电板。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-pixhawk-quadcopter-wiring-chart.rst:20
#: 6ebece033188418fa207047ba76e5eb8
msgid ""
"Default actual Motor number to Quadcopter frame location is shown below and "
"will require appropriate signal and motor wire routing. The assignment of "
"outputs to motor numbers can be changed by adjusting the ``SERVOx_FUNCTION``"
" values for each individual \"x\" output of the autopilot. Note that the "
"AUX1-6 outputs shown below correspond to SERVO9 - SERVO14, respectively."
msgstr ""
"默认的电机编号与四轴飞行器机架位置的对应关系如下所示，需要进行相应的信号线和电机线布线。输出到电机编号的分配可以通过调整飞控各个\"x\"输出的 "
"``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 值来更改。注意，下图所示的AUX1-6输出分别对应SERVO9至SERVO14。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-pixhawk-quadcopter-wiring-chart.rst:26
#: eb139a35bc3347009c1ac305d8943258
msgid ""
"A 3DR PPM-Sum encoder with conventional receiver is illustrated. Any "
"ArduPilot compatible receiver can be used. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"more options."
msgstr ""
"图中展示了一个使用传统接收机的3DR PPM-Sum编码器。可以使用任何ArduPilot兼容的接收机。更多选项请参见 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems` 。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-pixhawk-quadcopter-wiring-chart.rst:27
#: dd1e732141d146ad8f1051548a464f0c
msgid ""
"Generally a 3S or 4S LiPo battery is appropriate for a Quadcopter and the "
"XT60 connectors shown are a reliable choice."
msgstr "一般来说，3S或4S LiPo电池适合四轴飞行器，图中所示的XT60连接器是可靠的选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-pixhawk-quadcopter-wiring-chart.rst:29
#: 237e400ed1e24b90ab76f15af79e1a04
msgid ""
"An optional battery warning indicator can provide quick battery status and "
"provide an audible warning when nearby."
msgstr "可选的电池警告指示器可以提供快速的电池状态，并在附近时提供可听见的警告。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-pixhawk-quadcopter-wiring-chart.rst:31
#: f0f70113ce0b4f6f9f78042cbceda485
msgid ""
"Optional 3DR telemetry radios may be connected to your autopilot and tablet "
"or laptop to permit real time monitoring and operation."
msgstr "可选的3DR数传电台可以连接您的飞控和平板或笔记本电脑，实现实时监控和操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-pixhawk-quadcopter-wiring-chart.rst:34
#: 8be304c78ffa4b168a4e722383616d85
msgid ""
"A (GCS (Ground Control Station) program like Mission Planner, AndroPilot or "
"DroidPlanner provides in flight information and control."
msgstr "GCS（地面站）程序如Mission Planner、AndroPilot或DroidPlanner提供飞行中的信息和控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-pixhawk-quadcopter-wiring-chart.rst:38
#: d995d97a4f814c53b58054f519386615
msgid ""
"An optional GoPro camera and brushless gimbal are illustrated and can "
"provide very high quality photo and video results."
msgstr "图中展示了可选的GoPro相机和无刷云台，可以提供非常高质量的照片和视频效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-pixhawk-quadcopter-wiring-chart.rst:41
#: 7de1818af3484aa19cf136312af19d4e
msgid ""
"It is quite reasonable to use a GoPro camera and brushless gimbal on 400 and"
" larger Quadcopters."
msgstr "在400级及更大的四轴飞行器上使用GoPro相机和无刷云台是完全合理的。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-pixhawk-quadcopter-wiring-chart.rst:43
#: 934213b9a21f4118bb6b96a2e24a73e1
msgid ""
"Brushless camera gimbals perform more smoothly and adequately than the older"
" servo type gimbals."
msgstr "无刷相机云台比旧式舵机型云台表现更平稳、更充分。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-pixhawk-quadcopter-wiring-chart.rst:45
#: 75096876e19a49e5bce9be1a75871aed
msgid ""
"The brushless gimbal illustrated above has an anti-vibration mount which is "
"important for good photo results."
msgstr "上图所示的无刷云台有防震动安装座，这对于获得良好的照片效果非常重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-pixhawk-quadcopter-wiring-chart.rst:47
#: f9d2af6907f441ca95c6feb902742fc3
msgid ""
"For cameras larger than GoPro or \"Sport\" types, a larger QuadCopter, "
"HexaCopter or OctoCopter should be used."
msgstr "对于比GoPro或\"运动\"类型更大的相机，应使用更大的四轴、六轴或八轴飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-pixhawk-quadcopter-wiring-chart.rst:50
#: ee4de38a5c7b498290d654ea482645e0
msgid ""
"You could also install an optional FPV (First Person View) video system but "
"it is not shown in the illustration above."
msgstr "您也可以安装可选的FPV（第一人称视角）视频系统，但上图中未展示。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-pixhawk-quadcopter-wiring-chart.rst:53
#: 6c46ed49f087410683d29bb612dcf630
msgid ""
"An FPV system consists of a tiny video camera and transmitter on the copter "
"plus a receiver and video goggles or an LCD screen."
msgstr "FPV系统由飞行器上的微型摄像头和图传发射机，以及接收机和视频护目镜或LCD屏幕组成。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-pixhawk-quadcopter-wiring-chart.rst:55
#: aa45fd2dbe7a4424a074e21f8f396564
msgid "Almost any size Quadcopter can support a First Person View system."
msgstr "几乎任何尺寸的四轴飞行器都可以支持第一人称视角系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-pixhawk-quadcopter-wiring-chart.rst:56
#: 2f27fca7f2244a1b81e25603c8b6855a
msgid ""
"An optional OSD (On Screen Display) can add a video heads up display of "
"current in flight conditions to your FPV flight display."
msgstr "可选的OSD（屏幕显示）可以在您的FPV飞行显示中添加当前飞行状态的视频抬头显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-pixhawk-quadcopter-wiring-chart.rst:60
#: be0f6f090744497d997159577cc64f22
msgid ""
"The telemetry, camera, gimbal, FPV and OSD options mentioned above can be "
"combined as you wish for your copter, but start simple."
msgstr "上述的数传、相机、云台、FPV和OSD选项可以根据您的需要为飞行器自由组合，但建议从简单开始。"
